llection\n<MATH_0017> defines an element\nof the right hand side.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:b8aa8643b2042b8a4bf4af4dd0e9cf0a161ce53ec623ce4ed32719720b1d5808", "unit_id": "tag:05US:proof-p001"}
